<title>SPAIN: SPAIN'S TRADE DEFICIT TO NOVEMBER DOWN 14 PCT.</title>
<headline>SPAIN'S TRADE DEFICIT TO NOVEMBER DOWN 14 PCT.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1997-01-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Spain's accumulated trade deficit fell 14 percent in the first 11 months of 1996, Economy Minister Rodrigo Rato said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>&quot;The trade deficit has fallen 14 percent in the first 11 months of the year,&quot; Rato said at a conference.</p>
<p>Rato reiterated the need for continuing policies of macroeconomic stability to ensure sustained growth.</p>
<p>- Madrid Newsroom +341 585 2160</p>
